{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026liQ4DmSAvf1788330626.jpeg\"/><p style=\"text-align: left;\">粉嶺公路昨日（1 日）下午發生交通意外。一輛私家車行駛期間疑因行錯路切線，遭尾隨的泥頭車收掣不及撞向車尾，撞毀現場十多米水馬。私家車上 73 歲男司機及 69 歲女乘客受傷，清醒送院治理。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-02-11h24m27s315.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20266m5Re2rApo1788322234.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-02-11h24m27s315.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">網上流傳的車Cam片段所示，事發時涉事私家車疑行錯路，駛入前往深圳及只供貨車行駛的支線。私家車其後打算切線離開支線，惟尾隨的泥頭車疑收掣不及，直接撞向私家車車尾，現場有長約十多米的水馬被撞毀。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-02-11h24m38s835.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026ZcMRoEXXXp1788322240.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-02-11h24m38s835.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">事故中，私家車 73 歲男司機報稱頸部及胸口痛，同車 69 歲女乘客則報稱頸部及背部痛，兩人事後保持清醒，由救護車送往醫院治理。警方經調查後，初步相信私家車於切線期間，尾隨的泥頭車疑收掣不及撞上私家車肇禍。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-02T06:44:00.385976+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":295,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}